d bg-ds-black-200">3</span><span class="hidden sm:inline">Validation</span></button></div></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 lg:gap-5"><div data-slot="card" class="bg-white border border-ds-border-default hover:shadow-brand-purple ease-in-out h-full rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer group gradient-card-purple shadow-sm hover:shadow-md"><div data-slot="card-content" class="[&amp;:last-child]:pb-4 p-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6"><div class="size-11 rounded-xl bg-ds-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search size-5 text-ds-purple-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground">Desk Research</h3><p class="text-sm text-ds-black-500"></p></div></div><ul class="space-y-3"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-ds-black-500 group-hover:text-foreground transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-ds-purple-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span>Track cordless tool platform launches</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-ds-black-500 group-hover:text-foreground transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-ds-purple-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span>Map HS 8467 import exposure</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-ds-black-500 group-hover:text-foreground transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-ds-purple-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span>Review OSHA and UL compliance</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-ds-black-500 group-hover:text-foreground transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-ds-purple-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span>Benchmark construction and remodeling indicators</span></li></ul></div></div><div data-slot="card" class="bg-white border border-ds-border-default hover:shadow-brand-purple ease-in-out h-full rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer group gradient-card-purple shadow-sm hover:shadow-md"><div data-slot="card-content" class="[&amp;:last-child]:pb-4 p-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6"><div class="size-11 rounded-xl bg-ds-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big size-5 text-ds-purple-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground">Primary Research</h3><p class="text-sm text-ds-black-500"></p></div></div><ul class="space-y-3"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-ds-black-500 group-hover:text-foreground transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-ds-purple-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span>Interviews with tool category managers</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-ds-black-500 group-hover:text-foreground transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-ds-purple-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span>Procurement heads at electrical contractors</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-ds-black-500 group-hover:text-foreground transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-ds-purple-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span>Distributor merchandisers for pro trade</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-ds-black-500 group-hover:text-foreground transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-ds-purple-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span>Plant maintenance supervisors in manufacturing</span></li></ul></div></div><div data-slot="card" class="bg-white border border-ds-border-default hover:shadow-brand-purple ease-in-out h-full rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer group gradient-card-purple shadow-sm hover:shadow-md"><div data-slot="card-content" class="[&amp;:last-child]:pb-4 p-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6"><div class="size-11 rounded-xl bg-ds-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-check size-5 text-ds-purple-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground">Validation and Triangulation</h3><p class="text-sm text-ds-black-500"></p></div></div><ul class="space-y-3"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-ds-black-500 group-hover:text-foreground transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-ds-purple-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span>243 expert interviews cross-validated nationally</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-ds-black-500 group-hover:text-foreground transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-ds-purple-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span>Channel sell-in matched sell-out</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-ds-black-500 group-hover:text-foreground transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-ds-purple-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span>Volume-price checks by tool family</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-ds-black-500 group-hover:text-foreground transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-ds-purple-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span>Import volumes reconciled with revenues</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section id="faq-overview" class="py-12 lg:py-12 bg-ds-black-50 relative overflow-hidden"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-[16px] sm:px-10 lg:px-[40px] xl:px-[112.5px] relative"><div class="mb-16"><div class="mb-4"><h2 class="inline-flex font-dmsans items-center gap-2 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-ds-red-600">CHAPTER 12  -<!-- --> FAQ</h2></div><h2 class="font-noto mt-2 tracking-tight text-[#171717] text-[25px] lg:text-[31.25px] font-medium">FAQs</h2></div><div class="space-y-4" role="presentation"><section data-open="false" data-accordion-item="" class="border-b border-[#BDBDBD] data-[open=true]:border-KenRed px-2 pb-4 mt-2.5 bg-white border border-ds-black-200 rounded-[10px] px-6 hover:border-ds-black-300 transition-all duration-300 !border-b-[1px]"><button type="button" class="w-full text-left py-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 focus:outline-none text-base text-foreground font-semibold text-left hover:no-underline pt-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_jclinpfivedb_" data-open="false" data-accordion-trigger=""><span class="inline-flex items-center">What is the current size of the United States Power Tools Market?</span><svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform rotate-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><div style="display:grid;grid-template-rows:0fr;transition:grid-template-rows 200ms ease;opacity:0;transition-property:grid-template-rows, opacity" aria-hidden="true" data-open="false" data-accordion-content=""><div style="overflow:hidden"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-ds-black-500 mt-4">The United States Power Tools Market was valued at USD 11,400 Mn in 2024 on a producer and importer revenue basis. That translates into about 135 Mn units sold during the year, implying an average wholesale realization of roughly USD 84.4 per unit. The market is large because it is not dependent on one buyer group alone; demand is diversified across construction, industrial maintenance, automotive production, aerospace tooling, and DIY replacement purchases. Structurally, it is also supported by a deep installed base, estimated at 401 units per 1,000 persons, which keeps replacement and accessory demand recurring rather than purely cyclical.</p></div></div></section><section data-open="false" data-accordion-item="" class="border-b border-[#BDBDBD] data-[open=true]:border-KenRed px-2 pb-4 mt-2.5 bg-white border border-ds-black-200 rounded-[10px] px-6 hover:border-ds-black-300 transition-all duration-300 !border-b-[1px]"><button type="button" class="w-full text-left py-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 focus:outline-none text-base text-foreground font-semibold text-left hover:no-underline pt-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_lclinpfivedb_" data-open="false" data-accordion-trigger=""><span class="inline-flex items-center">How fast will the United States Power Tools Market grow through 2030?</span><svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform rotate-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><div style="display:grid;grid-template-rows:0fr;transition:grid-template-rows 200ms ease;opacity:0;transition-property:grid-template-rows, opacity" aria-hidden="true" data-open="false" data-accordion-content=""><div style="overflow:hidden"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-ds-black-500 mt-4">The base case points to steady rather than explosive growth. The United States Power Tools Market is projected to reach USD 13,995 Mn by 2030, up from USD 11,400 Mn in 2024, which implies a 3.5% CAGR during 2025-2030. Volume grows more slowly than value, at about 2.0% over the core five-year forecast spine, which means the market’s expansion is being driven partly by better product mix and higher realized pricing. In practical terms, growth should come from cordless upgrades, heavier-duty professional tools, and adjacent battery ecosystem monetization rather than mass-market volume spikes.</p></div></div></section><section data-open="false" data-accordion-item="" class="border-b border-[#BDBDBD] data-[open=true]:border-KenRed px-2 pb-4 mt-2.5 bg-white border border-ds-black-200 rounded-[10px] px-6 hover:border-ds-black-300 transition-all duration-300 !border-b-[1px]"><button type="button" class="w-full text-left py-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 focus:outline-none text-base text-foreground font-semibold text-left hover:no-underline pt-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_nclinpfivedb_" data-open="false" data-accordion-trigger=""><span class="inline-flex items-center">Where is the biggest profit-pool shift happening inside the market?</span><svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform rotate-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><div style="display:grid;grid-template-rows:0fr;transition:grid-template-rows 200ms ease;opacity:0;transition-property:grid-template-rows, opacity" aria-hidden="true" data-open="false" data-accordion-content=""><div style="overflow:hidden"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-ds-black-500 mt-4">The clearest profit-pool shift is from legacy corded and pneumatic categories toward professional cordless systems, especially in heavier-duty applications. Demolition tools are the fastest-growing product pool at 6.8% CAGR, while pneumatic tools are expanding only 1.2%, showing how quickly high-performance cordless systems are displacing older architectures in many use cases. At the same time, implied market ASP rises from USD 84.4 in 2024 to roughly USD 92.1 in 2030. That is commercially important because margins are usually stronger where suppliers can sell batteries, chargers, accessories, service, and fleet standardization rather than standalone tools only.</p></div></div></section><section data-open="false" data-accordion-item="" class="border-b border-[#BDBDBD] data-[open=true]:border-KenRed px-2 pb-4 mt-2.5 bg-white border border-ds-black-200 rounded-[10px] px-6 hover:border-ds-black-300 transition-all duration-300 !border-b-[1px]"><button type="button" class="w-full text-left py-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 focus:outline-none text-base text-foreground font-semibold text-left hover:no-underline pt-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_pclinpfivedb_" data-open="false" data-accordion-trigger=""><span class="inline-flex items-center">What is the biggest near-term risk to the United States Power Tools Market?</span><svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform rotate-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><div style="display:grid;grid-template-rows:0fr;transition:grid-template-rows 200ms ease;opacity:0;transition-property:grid-template-rows, opacity" aria-hidden="true" data-open="false" data-accordion-content=""><div style="overflow:hidden"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-ds-black-500 mt-4">The biggest near-term risk is cost and demand volatility occurring at the same time. On the cost side, tariff policy remains a sourcing risk following the USTR’s September 2024 Section 301 final action, while lithium battery logistics remain operationally complex under updated PHMSA guidance tied to rules effective May 10, 2024. On the demand side, consumer-facing channels are still exposed to housing normalization, with 2024 residential permits down 2.2% versus 2023. None of these individually break the market, but together they can squeeze gross margin, disrupt promotions, and slow inventory turns for import-dependent brands.</p></div></div></section><section data-open="false" data-accordion-item="" class="border-b border-[#BDBDBD] data-[open=true]:border-KenRed px-2 pb-4 mt-2.5 bg-white border border-ds-black-200 rounded-[10px] px-6 hover:border-ds-black-300 transition-all duration-300 !border-b-[1px]"><button type="button" class="w-full text-left py-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 focus:outline-none text-base text-foreground font-semibold text-left hover:no-underline pt-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_rclinpfivedb_" data-open="false" data-accordion-trigger=""><span class="inline-flex items-center">Which regions and end-use segments matter most for market entry or expansion?</span><svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform rotate-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><div style="display:grid;grid-template-rows:0fr;transition:grid-template-rows 200ms ease;opacity:0;transition-property:grid-template-rows, opacity" aria-hidden="true" data-open="false" data-accordion-content=""><div style="overflow:hidden"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-ds-black-500 mt-4">The South and construction-led demand pools matter most. The South represented USD 287.6 Bn of U.S. private nonresidential construction in 2024, and Construction accounts for the largest application share in this report’s segmentation framework. That combination matters because regions with heavier project pipelines also generate denser dealer throughput, higher replenishment frequency, and faster product trial for premium cordless systems. By contrast, purely consumer-led demand is broader geographically but usually more promotional and price-sensitive. For entry strategy, the most efficient path is typically South-focused pro distribution tied to construction, infrastructure, and industrial maintenance demand.</p></div></div></section><section data-open="false" data-accordion-item="" class="border-b border-[#BDBDBD] data-[open=true]:border-KenRed px-2 pb-4 mt-2.5 bg-white border border-ds-black-200 rounded-[10px] px-6 hover:border-ds-black-300 transition-all duration-300 !border-b-[1px]"><button type="button" class="w-full text-left py-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 focus:outline-none text-base text-foreground font-semibold text-left hover:no-underline pt-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_tclinpfivedb_" data-open="false" data-accordion-trigger=""><span class="inline-flex items-center">Which external demand indicators should executives track most closely?</span><svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform rotate-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><div style="display:grid;grid-template-rows:0fr;transition:grid-template-rows 200ms ease;opacity:0;transition-property:grid-template-rows, opacity" aria-hidden="true" data-open="false" data-accordion-content=""><div style="overflow:hidden"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-ds-black-500 mt-4">Three indicators matter most: residential permits, nonresidential construction, and infrastructure-industrial policy execution. Residential permits reached 1.478 Mn units in 2024, while total U.S. private nonresidential construction was USD 588.8 Bn. On top of that, the U.S. DOT allocated USD 61 Bn in FY2024 for highway formula programs, and CHIPS policy is expected to sustain fab-related construction deeper into the decade. Together, these indicators explain why the market can remain resilient even when one channel slows, because professional replacement demand is linked to project activity rather than only consumer confidence.</p></div></div></section></div><div class="mt-10 sm:mt-12 text-left p-5 sm:p-8 rounded-[10px] bg-black/[0.02] border border-black/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-4"><div><p class="text-[1rem] text-black mb-2">Still have questions?</p><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-ds-black-500 mt-4">Our research team is here to help you find the right solution</p></div><a class="text-KenRed font-semibold flex items-center gap-1 hover:underline" href="/custom-form/usa-power-tools-market">Contact Research Team <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section id="regional-adjacent-report" class="py-12 lg:py-12 bg-white relative overflow-hidden"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-[16px] sm:px-10 lg:px-[40px] xl:px-[112.5px] relative"><div class="mb-10"><div class="mb-4"><h2 class="inline-flex font-dmsans items-center gap-2 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-ds-red-600">CHAPTER 13 - Related Research</h2></div><h2 class="font-noto font-light mt-2 text-[39px] leading-tight tracking-tight text-[#171717]">Explore Related Reports</h2><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-ds-black-500 mt-4">Expand your market intelligence with complementary research across regions and adjacent markets.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 lg:gap-8 mb-12 items-start"><div data-slot="card" class="border hover:shadow-brand-purple ease-in-out bg-white border-transparent rounded-lg hover:shadow-none transition-all duration-300"><div data-slot="card-header" class="@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6 p-6 sm:p-8 pb-6"><h3 data-slot="card-title" class="text-base font-bold text-foreground flex items-center gap-3"><div class="size-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-ds-purple-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-globe size-5 text-ds-purple-500" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg></div><div><div>Regional/Country Reports</div><p class="text-sm font-normal text-ds-black-500 mt-1">Related market analysis across key regions</p></div></h3><div class="relative flex mt-8 border-b-2 border-ds-black-200 rounded-md bg-[#FCFCFC]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search absolute opacity-100 left-3 top-1/2 transform -translate-y-1/2 h-4 w-4 text-ds-purple-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle></svg><input type="text" placeholder="Search reports by name, region, or category..." class="flex-1 w-full bg-transparent outline-none px-2 pl-10 transition-all duration-500 ease-out focus:pl-2 text-[#464646] text-[16px] py-3" value=""/><span class="flex items-center top-1/2 transform -translate-y-1/2 justify-center absolute right-0 sm:right-1 h-7 w-7 rounded-full bg-ds-purple-500"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="text-white" height="16" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M438.6 278.6c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3l-160-160c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3L338.8 224 32 224c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l306.7 0L233.4 393.4c-12.5 12.5-12.5 32.8 0 45.3s32.8 12.5 45.3 0l160-160z"></path></svg></span></div></div><div data-slot="card-content" class="[&amp;:last-child]:pb-4 px-4 sm:px-8 pb-8"><div class="h-[200px] transition-all duration-300 "><ul class="space-y-2.5 pr-2"><li class="flex items-center justify-between group hover:bg-ds-black-50 px-1 sm:px-3 py-2 rounded-md transition-colors"><a class="flex w-full" href="industry-reports/indonesia-power-tools-market"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between text-foreground group-hover:text-foreground/80 transition-colors cursor-pointer"><span title="Indonesia Power Tools Market Size, Share &amp; Forecast, By Product Type, Application &amp; Sales Channel, 2025–2032" class="text-base block underline truncate">Indonesia Power Tools Market Size, Share &amp; Forecast, By Product Type, Application &amp; Sales Channel, 2025–2032</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div></a></li><li class="flex items-center justify-between group hover:bg-ds-black-50 px-1 sm:px-3 py-2 rounded-md transition-colors"><a class="flex w-full" href="industry-reports/vietnam-power-tools-market"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between text-foreground group-hover:text-foreground/80 transition-colors cursor-pointer"><span title="Vietnam Power Tools Market Outlook to 2030" class="text-base block underline truncate">Vietnam Power Tools Market Outlook to 2030</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div></a></li><li class="flex items-center justify-between group hover:bg-ds-black-50 px-1 sm:px-3 py-2 rounded-md transition-colors"><a class="flex w-full" href="middle-east-power-tools-market"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between text-foreground group-hover:text-foreground/80 transition-colors cursor-pointer"><span title="Middle East power tools market Size, Share, Growth Drivers, Trends, Opportunities &amp; Forecast 2025–2030" class="text-base block underline truncate">Middle East power tools market Size, Share, Growth Drivers, Trends, Opportunities &amp; Forecast 2025–2030</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div></a></li><li class="flex items-center justify-between group hover:bg-ds-black-50 px-1 sm:px-3 py-2 rounded-md transition-colors"><a class="flex w-full" href="industry-reports/ksa-power-tools-market"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between text-foreground group-hover:text-foreground/80 transition-colors cursor-pointer"><span title="KSA Power Tools Market outlook to 2029" class="text-base block underline truncate">KSA Power Tools Market outlook to 2029</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div></a></li><li class="flex items-center justify-between group hover:bg-ds-black-50 px-1 sm:px-3 py-2 rounded-md transition-colors"><a class="flex w-full" href="industry-reports/india-power-tools-market-research-report"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between text-foreground group-hover:text-foreground/80 transition-colors cursor-pointer"><span title="India Power Tools Market Forecast to 2021 - Rise in Infrastructural Projects and Expansion of Manufacturing Industry to Drive the Market" class="text-base block underline truncate">India Power Tools Market Forecast to 2021 - Rise in Infrastructural Projects and Expansion of Manufacturing Industry to Drive the Market</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div></a></li></ul></div></div><div class="relative w-full"><div class="relative flex justify-start py-6"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white to-white"></div><div class="z-10 relative my-2 ml-6 sm:ml-12 flex items-center gap-1 text-black hover:text-black/70"><button class="text-base font-dmsans">Show more</button><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div data-slot="card" class="border hover:shadow-brand-purple transition-shadow duration-[300ms] ease-in-out bg-white border-transparent rounded-lg hover:shadow-none"><div data-slot="card-header" class="@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6 p-6 sm:p-8 pb-6"><h3 data-slot="card-title" class="text-base font-bold text-foreground flex items-center gap-3"><div class="size-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-ds-purple-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-leaf size-5 text-ds-purple-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z"></path><path d="M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12"></path></svg></div><div><div>Adjacent Reports</div><p class="text-sm font-normal text-ds-black-500 mt-1">Related markets and complementary research</p></div></h3><div class="relative flex mt-8 border-b-2 border-ds-black-200 rounded-md bg-[#FCFCFC]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search absolute opacity-100 left-3 top-1/2 transform -translate-y-1/2 h-4 w-4 text-ds-purple-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle></svg><input type="text" placeholder="Search reports by name, region, or category..." class="flex-1 w-full bg-transparent outline-none px-2 pl-10 transition-all duration-500 ease-out focus:pl-2 text-[#464646] text-[16px] py-3" value=""/><span class="flex items-center top-1/2 transform -translate-y-1/2 justify-center absolute right-0 sm