Independent Automotive Workshops and Service Networks\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eCommercial Fleet, Logistics and Transportation Operators\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eGovernment and Regulatory Bodies including COSQC, General Commission for Customs and Ministry of Trade\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eInvestors and Venture Capitalist Firms\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eBanks, Financial Institutions and Automotive Trade Finance Providers\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"url_slug\":\"iraq-aftermarket-spare-parts-market\",\"position\":\"top\",\"font_color\":\"white\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://kenresearch.s3.amazonaws.com/products/category_images/2.7.jpg\",\"product_version\":\"v0.1\"},{\"product_title\":\"China Commercial Real Estate Market Outlook to 2027\",\"product_brief_detail\":\"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Target Audience\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cul\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eCommercial Real Estate Developers and Property Owners\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eInstitutional Real Estate Investors and Private Equity Funds\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eInvestors and Venture Capitalist Firms\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eCommercial Banks, Insurance Companies and Financial Institutions\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eCorporate Real Estate and Workplace Strategy Teams\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eRetail, Logistics and Industrial Property Operators\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eREIT Sponsors, Asset Managers and Investment Platforms\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eGovernment and Regulatory Bodies, including the Ministry of Housing and Urban-Rural Development, People\u0026#39;s Bank of China and National Financial Regulatory Administration\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"url_slug\":\"china-commercial-real-estate-market\",\"position\":\"top\",\"font_color\":\"white\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://kenresearch.s3.amazonaws.com/products/category_images/10.9.jpg\"